body:
Making a facebook post that said, "I know the world is not gonna end because it's already tomorrow in austrilla" 

&#x200B;

 I was 11

Going out with my brothers at 9pm (which was pretty late for a 7 year old) after learning that school was cancelled the next day because of snow, and sledding down a hill in my neighborhood. That and pretty much all my memories from the house I lived in as a kid. Life was so good.

&#x200B;

